# UI Stage Intro (Sanitized)

Public-friendly overview of the stage introduction experience.

## Overview
- Communicates stage titles and thematic framing in a modular overlay.
- Synchronizes with localization and accessibility systems.
- Supports dynamic data injection without revealing restricted storytelling beats.

## Sanitized Notes
- Alignment readouts, faction metrics, and conditional scripting have been redacted.
- Deprecated overlay history and migration steps remain available internally only.
- Consult the protected narrative bible for full sequencing and branching logic.
